  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with multiprofile, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion (e.g., config_033) achieve high accuracy. This experiment tests whether replacing the image encoder from resnet50 to imagenet_vit_l (a more advanced model) further improves performance while keeping other components (scvi_n200 RNA, transformer aggregation, weighted fusion) constant. This isolates the impact of the image encoder choice, a critical design decision, and leverages the strong prior evidence for transformer aggregation and weighted fusion."
}

